Z||000000||RedHaze86SD4||12-31-2001||08:02 AM||||Ok I know a lot of people had a great Christmas and I'm not trying to rain on anyones happy holidays. I also know that somewhere someone has had or is having a worse holiday than me... But unfortunately I'm not all that caring bout other people right now. I almost had to sell BOTH my Fieros. Thank God I didn't. ok heres whats up:<BR>I live(d) with my parents (again) on my grandfathers property. We've Technically been living there since '91. But I've been moving all over the place really. Anyways, my grandfather who is 90 just got really sick and almost died on us, so medicare and SSI stepped in to start paying for his care. Well what they never told us is that they use his property and assests to pay for everything and then when thats gone they pay for it. Well Luckily enough Texas just fixed that to where the land isn't part of the assests they use. But! Because theres people living on the land other than my Grandfather, they wouldn't pay because it was considered extra income. So it was either move off the land or pay $2500 a month for his care. Which we can't afford obviously. So my parents talked them into letting them stay as care takers of his land while hes in the home, but they have to pay frggin' rent of $400 a month just to stay! BS!! And we found all this out on Christmas Eve, which meant that Christmas day I spent moving to the only place I could find to live because, well honestly my younger days caught up with me and my credit rating is below dead. So now I'm living in a travel trailer thats like 3 feet behind my best freinds house. Which isn't that bad really but uhmmm this IS NOT the step foreward or backword or whatever that I wanted to be taking right now. And no thats not the only part to this story... See I'm also a sucker for certain females.. Go figure. So now the soap opera begins. (wheres your popcorn? this gets funny) <BR>I'm now living with my best friend and his fiancee who is pregnant, and his mom and his sister who is like 4 years younger than me and her 7 month old baby (who I been playing Daddy to for the last month  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) and yes folks shes pregnant again... Now don't go calling her a slut because I've already been through that with various friends of mine. But I'm not going to tell the story behind her kids either. But I understand whats up with her. Anyways, its soap opera time. She's not "attracted" to me, but yet she is, but she says shes not. And yes I'm very attracted to her. Fact mom has been riding us about being a married couple because of the way we act together. We've even slept together a couple of times. No ya dirty minded people I don't mean anything happened. We just actually SLEPT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Hard to explain but theres a very very good feeling that comes with having someone to sleep cuddled up next to. So thats my happy little family now.. Oh and for some more info. I have a friend that I met not long ago who has been trying to get me to date her. Shes a year older than me and has a 5 year old boy. Shes probably better looking than the one I live with but I don't really know because, well I'm kinda bias at the moment. Oh did I forget to tell you that the best friend's fiancee, his sister and the female thats been trying to go out with me... all have the same friggin' first name.... hmmmmmm... <BR>Oh and another thing I found out... not related to the above really but my 87 Fiero and my 91 Grand AM are still on the ranch so... Well the 2.5 in the Fiero was blown (I bought the car from Gold86SE) and the front of the grand am was all smashed up but the 2.5 still runs good. The Grand AM is a u code 2.5, not the best choice 2.5, but it fits in the 87 without any problems, plus it directly bolts to the eahaust manifold and the intake without any problems. And the DIS from the fiero fits into the newer block and it all works. So far anyways.<BR>Ok I'm done...